            Because the base is a slow-digesting milk protein, these shakes are filling for their calories, which is why many people use them as a light breakfast. If you are deciding between Premier and an older nutrition shake, our sibling guide <a href="/premier-protein-vs-ensure/">Premier Protein vs Ensure</a> compares the labels side by side.
