            Café Latte powder adds 95 mg of caffeine per serving, per Premier's product page, and is the flavor for people who want a cold protein coffee from a shaker. We could not find a current Amazon listing for it from Premier, so check Premier's store or a retailer. The newer Strawberry Milkshake lists 140 calories, the lowest of the range, and Chocolate Peanut Butter lists under 1 g of sugar.
